 - LED0 (PC05, active low) is a QEMU LED device; its state changes show
   in the ``led_set_intensity`` trace event. SW0 (PB19, to ground) is the
   machine property ``sw0-pressed``.
@@ -172,8 +177,7 @@ Missing devices
   RAMP2CS, CTRLBSET.IDXCMD, the outputs' start latency and the STATUS
   read lag.
 - PAC write protection, DSU CRC32 and chip erase, sleep modes and every other
-  peripheral behaviour (CCL, PDEC, CAN, ...). ADC
-  sequencing and event inputs, DAC START events.
